tpm2-abrmd: tpm2-abrmd (TPM2 Access Broker & Resource Manager)
tpm2-abrmd:
tpm2-abrmd: The TPM2 Access Broker and Resource Manager Daemon (tpm2-abrmd) is a
tpm2-abrmd: system daemon providing access to TPM2 hardware and simulator
tpm2-abrmd: resources through a D-Bus API. It implements the TCG TSS TCTI
tpm2-abrmd: (TPM Command Transmission Interface) for the tabrmd (TPM Access
tpm2-abrmd: Broker & Resource Manager Daemon).
tpm2-abrmd:
tpm2-abrmd: Features include transparent resource management of TPM objects,
tpm2-abrmd: session handling, and concurrent access for multiple consumers.
